    {
      "duration_ms": 11500,
      "caption": "A mispredicted branch flushes every younger ROB entry and rolls back rename state.",
      "narration": "When a branch resolves wrongly, everything younger in the ROB is squashed and the rename map is restored. Wrong-path work vanishes architecturally, though it can leave microarchitectural traces.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
